�
���1.当领主刷新出来后，玩家前往密境之地击败领主，领主携带的宝物会掉落在地上让玩家自由拾取。
2.玩家在密境地图无法互相进行攻击。
3.每次击败领主会根据当前领主的伤害排名，对具有不同贡献的玩家发放奖励。
排行奖励如下：
第1名           金币*15万   装备晶石*100
第2名           金币*10万   装备晶石*75
第3名           金币*7.5万   装备晶石*50
第4-5名       金币*5万  装备晶石*40
第6-10名     金币*3万  装备晶石*30
第11-20名   金币*2万 装备晶石*20
以上奖励在活动结束时通过邮件进行发放。"�1. When the Lord is refreshed, the player will go to the secret land to defeat the Lord, and the treasure carried by the Lord will fall on the ground for the player to pick up freely. 
2. Players cannot attack each other on the Secret Map. 
3. Each defeat of the Lord will reward players with different contributions according to the damage ranking of the current Lord.
Ranking rewards are as follows: 
1st Gold * 150,000 Equipped Spar * 100 
2nd Gold * 100,000 Equipped Spar * 75 
3rd Gold * 7.50,000 Equip Spar * 50 
4-5 Coins * 50,000 Equip Spar * 40 
6-10 Coins * 30,000 Equip Spar * 30 
11-20 Coins * 20,000 Equip Spar * 20 
The above rewards will be distributed by mail at the end of the event.
