�֨�猎人是擅长追踪、狩猎的职业，熟悉野外环境与猎物习性，运用弓箭、陷阱等工具，需具备敏锐观察力和野外生存能力。"�Hunters are masters of tracking and hunting. They possess an intimate knowledge of the wild and their prey, utilizing bows, traps, and their keen senses to survive and thrive in the wilderness.
�ר�驾驭魔力的智者，借符文与魔法引动冰火等力量，可远程打击敌人、施展防护法术，需精深学识支撑魔力运用。"�The Mage is a sage who wields arcane wisdom. Using runes and magic to channel elemental powers like ice and fire, they can strike foes from a distance and cast protective spells, all requiring profound knowledge to control their magic.
